INT. COUNTY FAIR - PIE-EATING CONTEST - JUDGES' TENT - DAY

Red-and-white striped canvas, folding tables, a banner: "47TH ANNUAL BLUEBERRY BLOWOUT." Flies circle a bowl of whipped cream.

MC BIFF DONNELLY (50s, straw hat, microphone) stands on a crate. GLORIA TREJO-LINDQVIST (60s, judge's sash, clipboard) sits at the center table. HIROSHI TANAKA (40s, judge, bib already stained) holds a spoon. DELIA OKONJO-BRANT (30s, junior judge, notebook) fans herself. WINSTON PERCY (70s, former champion, tweed blazer) leans on a cane. A WOMAN IN A VISOR (40s, sunburnt, sunglasses) lurks near the pies.

BIFF
Ladies and gentlemen, we are down to the final three contestants!

GLORIA
We are down to two. One was disqualified for swallowing the tin.

BIFF
It's still dramatic!

HIROSHI
(chewing)
This crust is excellent.

DELIA
Hiroshi, you're not supposed to eat the evidence.

HIROSHI
It's a pie. It's meant to be eaten.

WINSTON
In my day, you'd be thrown out for tasting.

GLORIA
In your day, Winston, you ate the judges.

WINSTON
Only once!

The woman in the visor steps forward, whispering something to Gloria. Gloria frowns.

GLORIA
Who are you?

WOMAN IN VISOR
Roxanne. Roxanne Pike. I'm entry number 14.

DELIA
Number 14 was disqualified.

ROXANNE
That's why I'm here to protest.

BIFF
Folks, we have a protest!

HIROSHI
Delia, hold my spoon.

DELIA
I'm holding my own.

WINSTON
Back in my day--

GLORIA
Winston.

WINSTON
Yes, dear.

Roxanne slams a pie tin onto the table. Blueberry sprays across Gloria's clipboard. Delia shrieks. Hiroshi dives. Biff leaps off the crate. Winston swings his cane and cracks the whipped cream bowl in two.

GLORIA
(shouting)
Order! Order at the fair!

ROXANNE
This pie was perfect!

HIROSHI
It was!

DELIA
It really was!

WINSTON
It was a masterpiece!

GLORIA
(quietly)
Fine. Reinstated.

Roxanne straightens. Wipes blueberry from her visor. Smiles for the first time.

BIFF
(into mic)
Folks, we have a winner!
